    "intro": {
      "zh": "Frogger 街机框体是 Konami 于 1981 年推出的经典街机，玩家操控一只青蛙先穿越多车道的公路、再跃过漂浮原木与乌龟的河流，抵达对岸的安全洞。它以「过马路 + 过河」的节奏与时机考验著称，是街机黄金时代动作/躲避类游戏的标志性名作，也是被移植到众多家用平台的经典之一。",
      "en": "The Frogger arcade cabinet, released by Konami in 1981, has players guide a frog across a busy multi-lane road and then hop over a river of floating logs and turtles to reach safe spots on the far bank. Renowned for its timing-based road-and-river crossing, it is a landmark action title of the golden age of arcade games and was ported to a vast range of home platforms."
    },
    "era": 1981,
    "manufacturer": "Konami"
  },
